                <pb facs="1181" n="1171" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1171"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.115/11–2849: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">McConaughy</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-11-28">November 28,
                        1949</date>.<lb/>[Received November 28—7:34 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4960. Message received by A. P. Pattison &amp; Company, Isbrandtsen agents
                    Shanghai, from master of SS <hi rendition="#italic">Sir John Franklin</hi> dated
                    November 28 at 1700 hours local time and while ship was proceeding up <pb
                        facs="1182" n="1172" xml:id="pg1172"/> Yangtze states that his ship was
                    shelled and hit but that he was proceeding with Chinese DE chasing. A second
                    message dated 1815 hours stated that he was still coming and would arrive
                    Woosung 1845 hours. Master requested that Woosung Fort be alerted and that
                    Whangpoo pilot be ready at daylight. Message stated that ship had been hit 12
                    times but was not shipping water. No injury to personnel. Full details
                    subsequent telegram.<anchor n="13" xml:id="d1167-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McConaughy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1167-f1" n="13" xml:id="d1167-f1-content">
                <p>“Telegram No. 4961, November 28, not printed; for more complete report, see
                    telegram No. 4977, November 29, <ref target="#pg1173">p. 1173</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
